  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Fix only the `SelectedWork` / work-wall section on mobile to match the attached reference screenshot.\n\nCurrent issue:\nThe rest of the responsive homepage is fixed, but the work wall does not match the desired phone layout.\n\nMobile design requirements (\342\211\244767px):\n\n- Keep the work wall as **two narrow vertical columns**, not one static gallery.\n- Each column should occupy roughly half of the viewport:\n  - outer page padding: `12px`\n  - column gap: `8px`\n  - each card width: `calc(50% - 4px)`\n- Use the existing Llamacorp project thumbnails only.\n- Cards should be stacked vertically with an `8px` gap, subtle 1px light border, white/light background, and no large border radius.\n- Left and right columns must continuously auto-scroll vertically in opposite directions:\n  - left column moves upward\n  - right column moves downward\n- Start the right column at a different vertical offset so both columns never show the same row at the same time.\n- Duplicate the project-card arrays to create a seamless infinite loop: no blank gap or visible jump when animation restarts.\n- The work wall itself should be a fixed visual window around `720\342\200\223900px` tall on phone, with `overflow-hidden`. It must not make the whole page horizontally scroll.\n- Keep the logo/trust marquee directly above the work wall, as in the reference.\n- Do not add a heading, overlay, dark filter, or extra copy over the work cards.\n- Make the images crisp and fully contained: `w-full h-auto object-cover`.\n- Do not use a desktop fixed width, `100vw` inside a padded container, negative horizontal margins, or horizontal transforms that cause cropping.\n\nTablet (768px\342\200\2231023px):\n- Use 2 columns with more spacing and a taller visible window.\n- Keep the same opposing infinite vertical scroll effect.\n\nDesktop (\342\211\2451024px):\n- Preserve the existing 4-column animated wall exactly as it is.\n\nPerformance/accessibility:\n- Pause animation when the section is off-screen if practical.\n- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: show the same two-column layout but without continuous movement.\n- Verify at 360px, 390px, 430px, 768px, and 1440px. There must be zero horizontal scrolling.\n\nAfter implementation, show a 390px mobile preview of only this section."
    items {
      text: "Fix only the `SelectedWork` / work-wall section on mobile to match the attached reference screenshot.\n\nCurrent issue:\nThe rest of the responsive homepage is fixed, but the work wall does not match the desired phone layout.\n\nMobile design requirements (\342\211\244767px):\n\n- Keep the work wall as **two narrow vertical columns**, not one static gallery.\n- Each column should occupy roughly half of the viewport:\n  - outer page padding: `12px`\n  - column gap: `8px`\n  - each card width: `calc(50% - 4px)`\n- Use the existing Llamacorp project thumbnails only.\n- Cards should be stacked vertically with an `8px` gap, subtle 1px light border, white/light background, and no large border radius.\n- Left and right columns must continuously auto-scroll vertically in opposite directions:\n  - left column moves upward\n  - right column moves downward\n- Start the right column at a different vertical offset so both columns never show the same row at the same time.\n- Duplicate the project-card arrays to create a seamless infinite loop: no blank gap or visible jump when animation restarts.\n- The work wall itself should be a fixed visual window around `720\342\200\223900px` tall on phone, with `overflow-hidden`. It must not make the whole page horizontally scroll.\n- Keep the logo/trust marquee directly above the work wall, as in the reference.\n- Do not add a heading, overlay, dark filter, or extra copy over the work cards.\n- Make the images crisp and fully contained: `w-full h-auto object-cover`.\n- Do not use a desktop fixed width, `100vw` inside a padded container, negative horizontal margins, or horizontal transforms that cause cropping.\n\nTablet (768px\342\200\2231023px):\n- Use 2 columns with more spacing and a taller visible window.\n- Keep the same opposing infinite vertical scroll effect.\n\nDesktop (\342\211\2451024px):\n- Preserve the existing 4-column animated wall exactly as it is.\n\nPerformance/accessibility:\n- Pause animation when the section is off-screen if practical.\n- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: show the same two-column layout but without continuous movement.\n- Verify at 360px, 390px, 430px, 768px, and 1440px. There must be zero horizontal scrolling.\n\nAfter implementation, show a 390px mobile preview of only this section."
    }
    media {
      mime_type: "image/png"
      blobref {
        blob_id: "/blobstore/prod/makersuite/spanner_managed/global::000054e2ea70026d:0000015f:2:000054e2ea70026d:0000000000000001::e304049722768521:00000210ac4018bc:000658010dabaedf"
      }
      uri: "image.png"
    }
  }
}
